---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const pageTitle = "Options & Upgrades | Appalachian Sheds Inc.";
const pageDescription = "Explore 25 detailed customization topics. Standard features remain included; optional work is identified and quoted separately.";
---
<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
<Fragment set:html={"<section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/resources/\">Resource Center</a> / Options &amp; Upgrades</div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Appalachian Sheds Inc.</div><h1>Make your building fit its purpose.</h1><a href=\"/options-gallery/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#cfb48d;color:#24302e;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:8px;margin:13px 0;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">Compare options visually \u2014 curated image gallery \u2192</a><p>Explore 25 detailed customization topics. Standard features remain included; optional work is identified and quoted separately.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse all 25 topics</a><a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"/planning-guides/\">Explore Building Guides</a></div></div></section><section class=\"wide\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"section-title\"><h2>Decide what matters before you choose upgrades.</h2><p>Consider site and structure first, then openings, exterior details, storage, utilities and finishing. Some decisions affect framing or trade coordination and should be made before construction begins.</p></div><div class=\"bar\"><strong>Standard means included.</strong> Model-standard components are not extra-cost upgrades. Available options and exact proposal scope vary by model and site. Painting or staining of the standard exterior shell is required within 30 days; optional ASI finishing is quoted separately.</div></div></section><section class=\"wide\" id=\"all-resources\" style=\"background:#eae8e2\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"section-title\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#896747\">Complete directory</div><h2>25 Options &amp; Upgrades</h2><p>Search by topic or narrow the list by decision category.</p></div><div class=\"control\" role=\"search\"><input aria-label=\"Search resource articles\" id=\"resource-search\" placeholder=\"Search titles and planning topics\" type=\"search\"/><select aria-label=\"Filter by category\" id=\"resource-category\"><option value=\"\">All topics</option></select></div><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"muted\" id=\"results-count\"></p><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{const i=document.querySelector('#resource-search'),s=document.querySelector('#resource-category'),cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('.tile[data-filter]')],count=document.querySelector('#results-count');if(!i||!s)return;const cats=[...new Set(cards.map(c=>c.dataset.category))];cats.forEach(c=>{let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=c;o.textContent=c;s.append(o)});function update(){let n=0;for(let c of cards){let v=c.dataset.filter.includes(i.value.trim().toLowerCase())&&(!s.value||c.dataset.category===s.value);c.hidden=!v;c.style.display=v?'':'none';if(v)n++}count.textContent=n+' resources displayed'}i.addEventListener('input',update);s.addEventListener('change',update);update()});</script><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Cost &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"options &amp; upgrades pricing overview cost &amp; site compare choices against an approved model and size before requesting a written price.\"><span class=\"number\">01 \u00b7 Cost &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/options-and-upgrades-pricing-overview/\">Options &amp; Upgrades Pricing Overview</a></h3><p>Compare choices against an approved model and size before requesting a written price.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/options-and-upgrades-pricing-overview/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Cost &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"site &amp; foundation options cost &amp; site a site-specific foundation decision depends on drainage, support and slope.\"><span class=\"number\">02 \u00b7 Cost &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/site-and-foundation-options/\">Site &amp; Foundation Options</a></h3><p>A site-specific foundation decision depends on drainage, support and slope.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/site-and-foundation-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Cost &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"flooring &amp; subfloor options cost &amp; site the included structural floor assembly is distinct from optional finish flooring.\"><span class=\"number\">03 \u00b7 Cost &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/flooring-and-subfloor-options/\">Flooring &amp; Subfloor Options</a></h3><p>The included structural floor assembly is distinct from optional finish flooring.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/flooring-and-subfloor-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"construction materials &amp; structural standards structure &amp; exterior the standard framing specification is the starting point, not an upgrade.\"><span class=\"number\">04 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/construction-materials-and-structural-standards/\">Construction Materials &amp; Structural Standards</a></h3><p>The standard framing specification is the starting point, not an upgrade.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/construction-materials-and-structural-standards/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Openings &amp; Access\" data-filter=\"door &amp; entry options openings &amp; access openings affect security, equipment access, wall layout and weather protection.\"><span class=\"number\">05 \u00b7 Openings &amp; Access</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/door-and-entry-options/\">Door &amp; Entry Options</a></h3><p>Openings affect security, equipment access, wall layout and weather protection.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/door-and-entry-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Comfort &amp; Utilities\" data-filter=\"electrical, lighting, hvac &amp; comfort systems comfort &amp; utilities plan utilities early, especially for spaces intended for frequent occupancy.\"><span class=\"number\">06 \u00b7 Comfort &amp; Utilities</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/electrical-lighting-hvac-and-comfort-systems/\">Electrical, Lighting, HVAC &amp; Comfort Systems</a></h3><p>Plan utilities early, especially for spaces intended for frequent occupancy.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/electrical-lighting-hvac-and-comfort-systems/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Cost &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"floor insulation &amp; underfloor comfort systems cost &amp; site insulation affects more than floor warmth; vapor and drying behavior matter.\"><span class=\"number\">07 \u00b7 Cost &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/floor-insulation-and-underfloor-comfort-systems/\">Floor Insulation &amp; Underfloor Comfort Systems</a></h3><p>Insulation affects more than floor warmth; vapor and drying behavior matter.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/floor-insulation-and-underfloor-comfort-systems/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Comfort &amp; Utilities\" data-filter=\"interior finish options comfort &amp; utilities a weather-tight shell does not include a finished room.\"><span class=\"number\">08 \u00b7 Comfort &amp; Utilities</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/interior-finish-options/\">Interior Finish Options</a></h3><p>A weather-tight shell does not include a finished room.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/interior-finish-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Comfort &amp; Utilities\" data-filter=\"interior insulation \u2014 wall &amp; ceiling systems comfort &amp; utilities interior insulation must work with moisture-control and ventilation strategies.\"><span class=\"number\">09 \u00b7 Comfort &amp; Utilities</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/interior-insulation-wall-and-ceiling-systems/\">Interior Insulation \u2014 Wall &amp; Ceiling Systems</a></h3><p>Interior insulation must work with moisture-control and ventilation strategies.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/interior-insulation-wall-and-ceiling-systems/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Storage &amp; Function\" data-filter=\"lofts, ladders &amp; stairs options storage &amp; function lofts and vertical storage require structural load and headroom planning.\"><span class=\"number\">10 \u00b7 Storage &amp; Function</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/lofts-ladders-and-stairs-options/\">Lofts, Ladders &amp; Stairs Options</a></h3><p>Lofts and vertical storage require structural load and headroom planning.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/lofts-ladders-and-stairs-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Comfort &amp; Utilities\" data-filter=\"plumbing &amp; water utility readiness comfort &amp; utilities water service can trigger additional site, permit and plumbing requirements.\"><span class=\"number\">11 \u00b7 Comfort &amp; Utilities</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/plumbing-and-water-utility-readiness/\">Plumbing &amp; Water Utility Readiness</a></h3><p>Water service can trigger additional site, permit and plumbing requirements.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/plumbing-and-water-utility-readiness/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"porches, awnings, dormers &amp; architectural roofline options structure &amp; exterior roofline changes affect geometry, flashing, framing and cost.\"><span class=\"number\">12 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/porches-awnings-dormers-and-architectural-roofline-options/\">Porches, Awnings, Dormers &amp; Architectural Roofline Options</a></h3><p>Roofline changes affect geometry, flashing, framing and cost.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/porches-awnings-dormers-and-architectural-roofline-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Openings &amp; Access\" data-filter=\"ramps, steps &amp; landings \u2014 building access openings &amp; access access improvements depend on door threshold, equipment and site slope.\"><span class=\"number\">13 \u00b7 Openings &amp; Access</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/ramps-steps-and-landings-building-access/\">Ramps, Steps &amp; Landings \u2014 Building Access</a></h3><p>Access improvements depend on door threshold, equipment and site slope.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/ramps-steps-and-landings-building-access/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"roofing &amp; roofline upgrades structure &amp; exterior roof covering and pitch must be compatible with manufacturer instructions.\"><span class=\"number\">14 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/roofing-and-roofline-upgrades/\">Roofing &amp; Roofline Upgrades</a></h3><p>Roof covering and pitch must be compatible with manufacturer instructions.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/roofing-and-roofline-upgrades/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Storage &amp; Function\" data-filter=\"shelving, workbenches &amp; storage options storage &amp; function storage improvements should be based on actual items and working clearances.\"><span class=\"number\">15 \u00b7 Storage &amp; Function</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/shelving-workbenches-and-storage-options/\">Shelving, Workbenches &amp; Storage Options</a></h3><p>Storage improvements should be based on actual items and working clearances.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/shelving-workbenches-and-storage-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"siding &amp; exterior finishes structure &amp; exterior compare the approved five siding systems on both appearance and maintenance.\"><span class=\"number\">16 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/siding-and-exterior-finishes/\">Siding &amp; Exterior Finishes</a></h3><p>Compare the approved five siding systems on both appearance and maintenance.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/siding-and-exterior-finishes/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"ventilation &amp; moisture control structure &amp; exterior ventilation and moisture management are building-system decisions.\"><span class=\"number\">17 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/ventilation-and-moisture-control/\">Ventilation &amp; Moisture Control</a></h3><p>Ventilation and moisture management are building-system decisions.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/ventilation-and-moisture-control/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Openings &amp; Access\" data-filter=\"skylights &amp; overhead daylight openings &amp; access overhead glazing adds light but also roof penetrations and flashing requirements.\"><span class=\"number\">18 \u00b7 Openings &amp; Access</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/skylights-and-overhead-daylight/\">Skylights &amp; Overhead Daylight</a></h3><p>Overhead glazing adds light but also roof penetrations and flashing requirements.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/skylights-and-overhead-daylight/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Openings &amp; Access\" data-filter=\"windows &amp; natural light options openings &amp; access window position affects usable wall space, daylight and privacy.\"><span class=\"number\">19 \u00b7 Openings &amp; Access</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/windows-and-natural-light-options/\">Windows &amp; Natural Light Options</a></h3><p>Window position affects usable wall space, daylight and privacy.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/windows-and-natural-light-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"paint, stain &amp; exterior finish systems structure &amp; exterior exterior protection is a necessary finishing decision, not merely a color preference.\"><span class=\"number\">20 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/paint-stain-and-exterior-finish-systems/\">Paint, Stain &amp; Exterior Finish Systems</a></h3><p>Exterior protection is a necessary finishing decision, not merely a color preference.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/paint-stain-and-exterior-finish-systems/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"cupolas &amp; weathervanes structure &amp; exterior decorative roof accessories should fit the architectural scale and roof assembly.\"><span class=\"number\">21 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/cupolas-and-weathervanes/\">Cupolas &amp; Weathervanes</a></h3><p>Decorative roof accessories should fit the architectural scale and roof assembly.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/cupolas-and-weathervanes/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"metal roofing vs architectural shingles structure &amp; exterior compare appearance, durability, pitch compatibility and installed system cost.\"><span class=\"number\">22 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/metal-roofing-vs-architectural-shingles/\">Metal Roofing vs Architectural Shingles</a></h3><p>Compare appearance, durability, pitch compatibility and installed system cost.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/metal-roofing-vs-architectural-shingles/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"fascia &amp; trim options structure &amp; exterior trim affects detailing and long-term exposure performance.\"><span class=\"number\">23 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/fascia-and-trim-options/\">Fascia &amp; Trim Options</a></h3><p>Trim affects detailing and long-term exposure performance.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/fascia-and-trim-options/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Exterior\" data-filter=\"decorative exterior accents structure &amp; exterior exterior accents should reinforce the model\u2019s architectural character.\"><span class=\"number\">24 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Exterior</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/decorative-exterior-accents/\">Decorative Exterior Accents</a></h3><p>Exterior accents should reinforce the model\u2019s architectural character.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/decorative-exterior-accents/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Cost &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"flooring &amp; structural floor systems cost &amp; site distinguish structural framing from decorative or finished flooring systems.\"><span class=\"number\">25 \u00b7 Cost &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/options-upgrades/flooring-and-structural-floor-systems/\">Flooring &amp; Structural Floor Systems</a></h3><p>Distinguish structural framing from decorative or finished flooring systems.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/options-upgrades/flooring-and-structural-floor-systems/\">Read option details \u2192</a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"wide\"><div class=\"shell visual\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#896747\">Your next best decision</div><h2>Choose the building around the work it needs to do.</h2><p>Start with use, site and budget; then choose size, roofline, openings, finishes and future improvements in the right order. Your written proposal should make included features and optional work clear.</p><a class=\"btn light\" href=\"/buildings/\">View Models &amp; Pricing</a></div><img alt=\"Appalachian Sheds Carriage Lane backyard building\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/models/carriage-lane.jpg\"/></div></section>"} />
</Base>

